## Approach

Three functional pieces: (1) mean node and mean apogee formulas with correction tables, (2) ECL_NUT dispatch path, (3) improved body routing in `Ephemeris::calc()`. The mean node/apogee work is the bulk — it requires two ~304-entry correction tables and implementing the computation + pipeline functions. The existing `mean_elements()` in `moshier/moon.rs` is reusable. The existing `app_pos_rest()` in `calc.rs` is also reusable — `app_pos_etc_mean` in C just converts ecliptic→equatorial and delegates to `app_pos_rest`.

The `plaus_iflag` AC is already satisfied by existing code for Moshier scope — the current implementation covers all rules in the C ref doc. Body-specific restrictions (HELCTR/BARYCTR rejection for mean elements) are handled in the dispatcher.

**C ref doc**: `docs/c-ref-mean-elements.md` — covers `app_pos_etc_mean()`, correction tables, and all mean element functions. Use this, not the C source.

